From: gaokun-Android project
Subject: [PATCH] tu: implement deferred VkNativeBufferANDROID binding
 (VkBindImageMemoryInfo with NULL memory)

现行版本 = **v3，按 A17 的 mesa 26.1.0-devel 重做**（2026-10-25；
`external/mesa3d` 来自 crDroid 17.0 / android-17.0.0_r1）。
由 `scripts/mesa-a17/regen.sh` 在生成 Android.bp 之前打上（幂等）。

问题：Android 的 libvulkan 对 swapchain image 走**延迟绑定** ——
vkCreateImage 时**不带** VkNativeBufferANDROID（于是 vk_android_import_anb()
从未运行、vk.anb_memory 为空），gralloc buffer 是在 vkBindImageMemory2 这一刻
才通过 pNext 递进来的，而 `VkBindImageMemoryInfo::memory` 是 VK_NULL_HANDLE：

    P1 NULL-bind pNext=[1000010000, 1000060009]   ← NATIVE_BUFFER_ANDROID
                                                    + BIND_IMAGE_MEMORY_SWAPCHAIN_INFO_KHR
    caller: libGLESv2_angle.so → libvulkan.so → vulkan.freedreno.so

turnip 在这条路上只有一句 `/* TODO handle VkNativeBufferANDROID */` +
`UNREACHABLE(...)`（26.1 仍然如此，tu_image.cc 的 tu_image_bind()）。release 下
UNREACHABLE 是 UB；就算"安全跳过"，image 也永远没有内存、iova 恒 0 →
GPU 往地址 0 写 → 本平台 GPU SMMU translation fault → context-fault 中断打不到
CPU → stall 死锁（docs/stage5-freedreno.md D5–D10）。

v3 的修法（全用 runtime 现成 helper，可直接提上游）：
  ① 用 bind info 里的 ANB 造一份等价 VkImageCreateInfo；
  ② vk_android_get_anb_layout() 取 gralloc buffer 的真实 modifier / plane layout
     → tu_image_update_layout() 重算布局（image 默认 UBWC，gralloc 可能给 LINEAR，
     不重算就错位 + 越界写）；
  ③ vk_android_import_anb() 导入 dma-buf 并绑定（它自己再调一次 BindImageMemory2，
     那次 memory 非空，走正常路径落 mem / iova）；重复绑定先 FreeMemory 上一块，
     否则 BufferQueue 每轮转一次漏一个 dma-buf；
  ④ 既无 ANB 又无已导入内存：跳过而不是 UB，mesa_logw 限流吼一声；
  ⑤ tu_allocate_transient_attachments() 加 `iview->image->mem &&`，
     未绑定内存的 attachment 不解引用 mem。
实测（A16，mesa 26.0.3 上的同一份逻辑）：SMMU fault 66 → 0，screencap 从永久卡死
变成正常出图（stage5-freedreno.md D10）。

与 A16 归档树（~/keep/mesa3d-patched.tar.zst，26.0.3）里那份的差别：
  * 去掉了 B1 诊断探针 P1 / P2 / P3 和 gaokun_dump_image() / gaokun_dump_callers()
    （D10 定案后只剩打日志的作用；P2 在 tu_image_view_init 里每个未绑定 view 都要判断）；
  * 注释改成英文，便于提上游；逻辑逐行相同。
  * 26.1 的 tu_image_bind() 结构与 26.0.3 相同（逐个 bind_info 调用），锚点只是行号变了。

历史：v1（no-op 返回，从不给 image->mem 赋值 → 用户态 NULL 解引用 + iova 0）
与 v2（只找 create 时的 anb_memory，延迟绑定下它当然是空的）都错，见
stage5-freedreno.md D9 / D10；当年的增量脚本在 scripts/gmu-forensics/apply-0004v{2,3}.py。

Apply to: external/mesa3d（A17，mesa 26.1.0-devel）

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
index 42a0416..9a2246e 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
@@ -3679,8 +3679,13 @@ tu_allocate_transient_attachments(struct tu_cmd_buffer *cmd, bool sysmem)
 
    for (unsigned i = 0; i < fb->attachment_count; i++) {
       const struct tu_image_view *iview = cmd->state.attachments[i];
+      /* An attachment without bound memory (see the NULL-memory bind path in
+       * tu_image_bind) needs no lazy allocation; don't dereference mem.
+       * (gaokun patch 0004)
+       */
       if (iview && !(iview->image->vk.create_flags &
                      VK_IMAGE_CREATE_SPARSE_BINDING_BIT) &&
+          iview->image->mem &&
           !iview->image->mem->bo &&
           (sysmem || rp->attachments[i].load ||
            rp->attachments[i].load_stencil ||
diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
index 88df2a0..e838efd 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
@@ -1010,8 +1010,84 @@ tu_image_bind(struct tu_device *device,
 
    if (!mem) {
 #if DETECT_OS_ANDROID
-      /* TODO handle VkNativeBufferANDROID */
-      UNREACHABLE("VkBindImageMemoryInfo with no memory");
+      /* Android's libvulkan uses deferred binding for swapchain images: the
+       * image is created without VkNativeBufferANDROID and the gralloc buffer
+       * only arrives here, chained into the VkBindImageMemoryInfo with a NULL
+       * memory handle (observed pNext: NATIVE_BUFFER_ANDROID +
+       * BIND_IMAGE_MEMORY_SWAPCHAIN_INFO_KHR, caller ANGLE -> libvulkan).
+       * Leaving the image unbound means iova == 0 and the GPU writes to
+       * address 0 (SMMU translation faults).  (gaokun patch 0004 v3)
+       */
+      const VkNativeBufferANDROID *anb =
+         vk_find_struct_const(bind_info->pNext, NATIVE_BUFFER_ANDROID);
+      if (anb) {
+         /* Build an equivalent create info pointing at this ANB so the two
+          * runtime helpers (both keyed on VkImageCreateInfo) can be reused.
+          */
+         VkImageCreateInfo anb_ci = {
+            .sType = VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_IMAGE_CREATE_INFO,
+            .pNext = (const void *) anb,
+            .flags = image->vk.create_flags,
+            .imageType = image->vk.image_type,
+            .format = image->vk.format,
+            .extent = image->vk.extent,
+            .mipLevels = image->vk.mip_levels,
+            .arrayLayers = image->vk.array_layers,
+            .samples = (VkSampleCountFlagBits) image->vk.samples,
+            .tiling = image->vk.tiling,
+            .usage = image->vk.usage,
+            .sharingMode = image->vk.sharing_mode,
+            .initialLayout = VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_UNDEFINED,
+         };
+
+         /* Recompute the layout from the gralloc buffer's real modifier and
+          * plane layout: the image defaults to UBWC while gralloc may hand us
+          * LINEAR, and a stale layout means misplaced rendering and
+          * out-of-bounds writes.
+          */
+         VkImageDrmFormatModifierExplicitCreateInfoEXT anb_eci;
+         VkSubresourceLayout anb_plane_layouts[TU_MAX_PLANE_COUNT];
+         result = vk_android_get_anb_layout(&anb_ci, &anb_eci,
+                                            anb_plane_layouts,
+                                            TU_MAX_PLANE_COUNT);
+         if (result != VK_SUCCESS)
+            return result;
+
+         result = TU_CALLX(device, tu_image_update_layout)(
+            device, image, anb_eci.drmFormatModifier, anb_plane_layouts);
+         if (result != VK_SUCCESS)
+            return result;
+
+         /* Import the dma-buf and bind it.  vk_android_import_anb() stores the
+          * dedicated allocation in vk.anb_memory and calls BindImageMemory2
+          * again with a real memory handle, which takes the normal path below
+          * and sets mem/iova.  BufferQueue re-binds the same image, so free
+          * the previous import first or every rotation leaks a dma-buf.
+          */
+         if (image->vk.anb_memory != VK_NULL_HANDLE) {
+            device->vk.dispatch_table.FreeMemory(tu_device_to_handle(device),
+                                                 image->vk.anb_memory, NULL);
+            image->vk.anb_memory = VK_NULL_HANDLE;
+         }
+
+         return vk_android_import_anb(&device->vk, &anb_ci, NULL, &image->vk);
+      }
+
+      if (image->vk.anb_memory != VK_NULL_HANDLE) {
+         /* Re-bind of an image whose ANB was imported at vkCreateImage time. */
+         mem = tu_device_memory_from_handle(image->vk.anb_memory);
+         offset = 0;
+      } else {
+         /* Nothing to bind.  Skip instead of hitting UNREACHABLE (UB in
+          * release builds), but complain: this image will render at iova 0.
+          */
+         static unsigned n_unbindable = 0;
+         if (n_unbindable++ < 8)
+            mesa_logw("NULL-memory bind without VkNativeBufferANDROID or "
+                      "imported ANB memory (#%u), image %p stays unbound",
+                      n_unbindable, (void *) image);
+         return VK_SUCCESS;
+      }
 #else
       const VkBindImageMemorySwapchainInfoKHR *swapchain_info =
          vk_find_struct_const(bind_info->pNext,
